# Find in River.epub. The lens in the controls opens the reader's keyboard,
# the results say how many passages have the words and list each with a line
# of context and its page, a result goes to its page with the words marked,
# and the way back to the page the search was made from is Back, or the
# control that names that page.
wait-for River
tap River
wait-for Marker 1
page next
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 2 of
shot books-find-controls
tap-id reader-find
wait-for-id kb.enter
expect A word or a few words
shot books-find
type marker 9
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for is in 2 passages
expect This is reading marker 9.
expect Search again
shot books-found
tap-id reader-found-1
wait-for reading marker 8.
expect-missing passages
shot books-found-page
# The controls name the page Back leads to, and the control goes there.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Back to page 2
shot books-found-return
tap Back to page 2
wait-idle
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 2 of
expect-missing Back to page
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
# Back does the same from the page itself.
tap-id reader-controls
tap-id reader-find
wait-for is in 2 passages
tap-id reader-found-0
wait-for reading marker 8.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 2 of
# The last search is kept. Search again opens the field with its words in
# it, and a word in every paragraph pages its results.
tap-id reader-find
wait-for is in 2 passages
tap Search again
wait-for-id kb.enter
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type bench
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for is in 40 passages
expect A wooden bench faces the bend.
shot books-found-many
tap-id reader-list-next
wait-for 2 of
# Words that are not in the book are said not to be.
tap Search again
wait-for-id kb.enter
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type heron
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Nothing here matches
shot books-found-none
tap Back to the book
wait-idle
expect-missing Nothing here matches
expect reading marker
